# Office C2R Quick Update

## 1. Check Running Apps
```powershell
Get-Process -Name WINWORD, EXCEL, POWERPNT, OUTLOOK, MSACCESS -EA SilentlyContinue
2. Trigger Update
PowerShell
& "$env:ProgramFiles\Common Files\microsoft shared\ClickToRun\OfficeC2RClient.exe" /update user displaylevel=false forceappshutdown=false
(If no apps are open, the update downloads and applies immediately).

3. Check Version
PowerShell
(Get-ItemProperty "HKLM:\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Office\ClickToRun\Configuration").VersionToReport
